%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant SW as Software
    participant CORE as AOU_CORE
    participant BRG as AOU_FDI_BRINGUP_CTRL
    participant ADP as UCIe Adapter
    participant REM as Remote die
    Note over CORE,ADP: Link Active, AoU DISABLED
    SW->>ADP: Link Disable on the UCIe controller
    ADP->>BRG: pl_rx_active_req = 0
    BRG->>ADP: lp_rx_active_sts = 0
    ADP->>BRG: pl_state_sts = Disabled (1100), pl_inband_pres = 0
    Note over CORE,ADP: LINKDOWN - lp_state_req = NOP, lp_wake_req = 0, O_FDI_LINK_UP = 0, O_FDI_FSM_STATE = 0xC
    BRG->>CORE: O_INT_FSM_IN_ACTIVE = 0
    Note over CORE: already DISABLED - no INT_FDI_LINK_DOWN
    ADP->>BRG: pl_state_sts = Reset (0000)
    Note over BRG: RESET - NOP held while the link is down
    opt an activation request arrives meanwhile
        SW->>CORE: APB write AOU_INIT.ACTIVATE_START = 1
        Note over CORE,BRG: waits for O_INT_FSM_IN_ACTIVE - nothing wakes the link in RESET (NOP held)
    end
    SW->>ADP: Start UCIe Link Training on the UCIe controller
    ADP->>BRG: pl_inband_pres = 1, pl_clk_req = 1
    Note over BRG,ADP: bring-up as in the cold bring-up sequences, through to ACTIVE
    BRG->>CORE: O_INT_FSM_IN_ACTIVE = 1
    CORE->>REM: ActivateReq
    REM->>CORE: ActivateAck
    Note over CORE: ENABLED
